--[[
    Emote Hub - standalone GUI version (v2)
    ---------------------------------------
    Tabs
      Emotes     - scrolling thumbnail grid, click to play
      Favorites  - everything you starred
      Anim Packs - animation packs; click one to apply it, click it again to reset.
                   Chips at the bottom (All / Idle / Walk / Run / Jump / Fall) choose
                   whether a click applies the whole pack or just that part
      Binds      - keybinds you saved for emotes / packs

    How to make a keybind
      Press the small BIND button on any card (or right-click the card),
      then press the key you want. Esc cancels. Press the key in-game to run it.
      Pressing a bound emote's key again while it plays stops it.
      Reserved keys: W A S D Space Tab /

    Performance
      * Cards are pooled and reused as you scroll
      * The grid is virtualised: only the rows on screen exist, however long the list
      * Scrolling and resizing only touch the few cards on screen
      * Pack data is cached to disk after the first time you use a pack

    Emote / animation lists come from the same JSON sources as the original script.
    Emotes use Humanoid:PlayEmoteAndGetAnimTrackById, so they need an R15 character.
]]

